<title>UK: SBC sets call warrants on Dixons.</title>
<headline>SBC sets call warrants on Dixons.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss Bank Corp has issued 10 million American-style call warrants on shares of Dixons Group Plc, lead manager SBC Warburg said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    5.20 STG		  PREMIUM	118 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.62 STG		  GEARING	8.0 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   20.NOV.98		 PAYDATE	27.MAY.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  4.95 STG</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
